WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.175
One oven, six hours.

2
00:00:02.626 --> 00:00:07.326
The oven has six hours. Each hour bakes ten pies, or twenty muffins.

3
00:00:09.244 --> 00:00:12.219
One more hour on pies makes ten more pies.

4
00:00:13.271 --> 00:00:17.521
But that hour can't bake muffins as well, so twenty fewer muffins.

5
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:22.125
Those twenty muffins are the opportunity cost of the ten pies.
